.TH mnnn-org-template 1  "mnnn-org-template 2.25.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-org\-template \- Site templates and their assets
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn org template\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-transport\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Site templates and their assets
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write logs to this file instead of stderr (the TUI defaults to <home>/logs/tui.log)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_LOG_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-transport\fR \fI<stream|poll>\fR
How live collaboration reaches peers: `stream` (gRPC streams, the default) or `poll` (requests over the peer connection; for containers). Overrides MUNINN_COLLAB_TRANSPORT and the `net config \-\-collab\-transport` setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-list(1)
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-save(1)
Save a template (placeholders: {{title}} {{org.name}} {{org.description}} {{content}} {{css}} {{assets}} {{base}})
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-asset(1)
Add an asset (image, font, script, style) to a template, or remove one with \-\-remove
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-show(1)
A template\*(Aqs HTML, CSS, files and build step
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-edit(1)
Edit a template\*(Aqs HTML (or \-\-css) in $VISUAL/$EDITOR; a new name starts from the built\-in look
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-remove(1)
Remove a template (orgs using it go back to the built\-in look)
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-build(1)
Set a template\*(Aqs build step and run it (asks before a new or changed command)
.TP
mnnn\-org\-template\-preview(1)
A live preview link for a template through the local host (good for an hour)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
